	(text "Flash usage for different pinouts:\n- 27C010, 27C1001, 27C1000A, 39SF010\n   1Mbit/17-bit = 128KB on flash\n- D23C1001\n   1MBit/17-bit = 128KB on flash\n- 27C301, 27C100, 27C1000\n   1Mbit/17-bit = 256KB on flash\n   Requires 18 address GPIOs\n- 27C020, 27C2001, 39SF020\n   2MBit/18-bit = 256KB on flash\n- 27C040, 27C4001, HN62404, HN62424\n   4MBit/19-bit = 512KB on flash\n- 39SF040\n   4Mbit/19-bit = 512KB on flash\n- Half 27C080\n   4Mbit/19-bit = 512KB on flash"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
